","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"68AYY0l4jZMAr3lOGHuLvA","review_id":"6HWJwtDidjSk9or3YTfd-w","date":"2012-05-14T19:30:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9362173676490784,"text_excerpt":"Dos Jefes gets a double dos of love from Yours, Truly. Cigar smoke normally makes me want to puke. I'm also used to cigar bars in Manhattan that are full of wealthy, old business men and high end call girls all done-up, trashed-out and on the make, so that might add to the nausea that ensues. Rejoice, for Dos Jefes has a completely different environment and just the kind I like- smoky, dark, lively; very much evocative of a different time and place. They regularly have live music that only adds to the whole pre-Castro jazz club in Havana feel. This past Saturday night there was no cover (tip the musicians, please!) And there's a swell patio. And a more than decent wine selection. Cigars? ..."},{"business_id":"68AYY0l4jZMAr3lOGHuLvA","review_id":"Y8I6nbBEMkuLYJu1CU-zRQ","date":"2018-01-22T15:50:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9350042939186096,"text_excerpt":"If you're into cigars, this place is for you. They offer a huge amount of cigars for sale and allow smoking indoors. They always have an amazing band playing in the front and drinks for a reasonable price. Lots of seating and a nice pool table in the back. The only bad thing about this place is that if you don't like smoking, it really smells like cigars and the ventilation isn't great so you'll definitely smell like smoke after leaving."},{"business_id":"68AYY0l4jZMAr3lOGHuLvA","review_id":"7Now0ycX4KGpTqfUWpx7lw","date":"2011-03-06T03:30:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9315561056137085,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! Live music nightly, great selection of cigars and high-end smokes. Awesome happy hour with $2 domestics, $3 wine, and $4 martinis. Outdoor area with swings by the bar :)"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"68AYY0l4jZMAr3lOGHuLvA","photo_id":"R4sSWuk3ls5Mbu-FKdAY6g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/R4sSWuk3ls5Mbu-FKdAY6g.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
